{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026wgPDSFDDcq1794562378.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>港隊在名古屋亞殘運取得3金、14銀、24銅。行政長官李家超出席嘉許禮，讚揚運動員表現卓越。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.PARA-1600-1_CLEAN_20261113_171513.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026XhvLdHrN8E1794562386.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>行政長官李家超說：「你們以行動證明，真正的強大，在於不斷堅持、敢於突破。你們在亞殘運會的競技舞台上，展現堅毅不屈、永不言敗的香港精神，身體力行說好香港故事，為國家體育事業增添光彩。」</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.PARA-1600-1_CLEAN_20261113_171513_002.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026GeQ248IbD91794562398.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>嘉許禮在馬鞍山體育館舉行，李家超向運動員頒發嘉許狀。他說本年度政府會向體院提供約7,100萬元，培訓殘疾精英運動員，預算較5年前增加超過5成。亦在殘疾運動精英級別中，增設成年隊級別，未來會繼續透過體院提供訓練場地、專業教練，以及運動科學和運動醫學服務，協助運動員不斷提升水平。</p><p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-13T09:59:30.914643+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":276,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-13T08:08:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-14T12:58:37.584756+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-13T09:52:48.267463+00:00","content_hash":"ad189b74d06de5beb511534b7fefd0c23246bcaeaa950d0d768c6deeb569efc4","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-13T09:59:30.914643+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}